sinc.com','Re: Rethinking telecom procurement at R.L. Schreiber, Inc. Flavor Purveyors','<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none\">\r\n<!--\r\np\r\n	{margin-top:0;\r\n	margin-bottom:0}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hi Scott,</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I appreciate the kind offer to discuss, but we don\'t have a business need.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks,</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-Yorck</div><div id=\"appendonsend\"></div><hr tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"display:inline-block; width:98%\"><div id=\"divRplyFwdMsg\" dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"><b>From:</b> Scott Mercer &lt;smercer@1cloudnow.com&gt;<br><b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, April 8, 2026 10:07 AM<br><b>To:</b> Yorck Haase &lt;Yphaase@rlsinc.com&gt;<br><b>Subject:</b> [External] Rethinking telecom procurement at R.L. Schreiber, Inc. Flavor Purveyors</font> <div>&nbsp;</div></div><div><p>Yorck,</p><p>1Cloud Communications is an independent telecom advisor.&nbsp; We give organizations like R.L. Schreiber, Inc. Flavor Purveyors instant access to competitive pricing across 400+ providers.</p><p>30 years on the carrier side at executive levels.&nbsp; We manage the full lifecycle - discovery through ongoing performance management.&nbsp; If a provider isn\'t delivering, we move fast.</p><p>Open to a conversation about how this could benefit R.L. Schreiber, Inc. Flavor Purveyors?</p><p>Scott Mercer<br>Enterprise Account Executive<br>1Cloud Communications</p></div></body></html>','Hi Scott,\r\nI appreciate the kind offer to discuss, but we don\'t have a business need.\r\nThanks,\r\n-Yorck\r\n________________________________\r\nFrom: Scott Mercer <smercer@1cloudnow.com>\r\nSent: Wednesday, April 8, 2026 10:07 AM\r\nTo: Yorck Haase <Yphaase@rlsinc.','2026-04-08 14:45:42','neutral',0,NULL,NULL),(13,NULL,1,'digital@validity.com','Deliverability insights you don’t want to miss 📩','<html lang=\"en\"><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><meta name=\"ROBOTS\" content=\"NOINDEX, NOFOLLOW\"><meta content=\"IE=edge\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no,date=no,address=no,email=no\"><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark only\"><meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark only\"><meta content=\"Validity\"><style type=\"text/css\">\r\n<!--\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\'proxima_nova\';\r\n	font-weight:normal;\r\n	font-style:normal}\r\n@font-face\r\n	{font-family:\'proxima_nova\';\r\n	font-weight:bold;\r\n	font-style:normal}\r\n-->\r\n</style><style type=\"text/css\">\r\n<!--\r\n@media only screen {\r\n.blockDT\r\n	{display:block}\r\n.wrapper\r\n	{min-width:800px!important}\r\n.hideDT\r\n	{display:none!important}\r\n.showDT\r\n	{display:block!important;\r\n	width:100%!important;\r\n	height:auto!important;\r\n	min-height:1px!important}\r\n\r\n	}\r\n[class~=\"x_blockDT\"]\r\n	{display:block}\r\n[class~=\"x_wrapper\"]\r\n	{min-width:360px!important}\r\n@media only screen and (max-width: 599px) {\r\n.wrapper\r\n	{min-width:360px!important}\r\n.max\r\n	{width:100%!important;\r\n	max-width:none!important;\r\n	float:none!important}\r\n.blockDT\r\n	{display:inline!impo