"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"none\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:800px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" class=\"\" style=\"padding:30px 0 32px\"><div align=\"center\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"https://click.validity.com/e/1088342/2026-04-08/97bg9b/3101670558/h/C99RGG4gM1RzPd0Ng7OpAoC168DUPSfxAjf-fUI7ozc\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"State of Email Trends logo\" border=\"0\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://campaigns.litmus.com/_email/2026/SOE%20Template/state_of_email_trends_logo.png\" width=\"258\" style=\"display:block\"></a></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:44px 20px 26px\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"none\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:600px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" class=\"\" style=\"padding:0 0 50px\"><p align=\"center\" class=\"whale\" id=\"root\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#04363E; margin:0 0 30px\"><span class=\"linkfix\" id=\"linkfix\"><strong><span style=\"display:inline\">🗓️</span> April 15 | <span style=\"display:inline\">✨</span> Virtual event | <span style=\"white-space:nowrap; display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display:inline\">⏰</span>&nbsp;12pm&nbsp;ET/4pm&nbsp;GMT</span></strong></span></p><h1 align=\"center\" class=\"whale\" style=\"font-size:45px; line-height:58px; font-weight:700; color:#04363E; margin:0 0 30px\"><a href=\"https://click.validity.com/e/1088342/l-1088342-2026-03-30-979n7k/97bg9f/3101670558/h/C99RGG4gM1RzPd0Ng7OpAoC168DUPSfxAjf-fUI7ozc\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#04363E; text-decoration:none\">New email deliverability data unpacked</a></h1><p align=\"left\" class=\"whale\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#04363E; margin:0 0 30px\">Our team crunched trillions of data points from global inboxes to bring you insights that will move the needle.</p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"buttonBlue\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#0A8DFF; box-shadow:0 3px 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.20); border-radius:25px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" background=\"https://campaigns.litmus.com/_email/2026/Product%20Announcement%20Email%20-%20Deliverability/bg_blue.png\" class=\"offwhite\" style=\"background-image:url(\'https://campaigns.litmus.com/_email/2026/Product%20Announcement%20Email%20-%20Deliverability/bg_blue.png\'); background-size:cover; background-repeat:repeat; border-radius:25px\"><a href=\"https://click.validity.com/e/1088342/l-1088342-2026-03-30-979n7k/97bg9f/3101670558/h/C99RGG4gM1RzPd0Ng7OpAoC168DUPSfxAjf-fUI7ozc\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block; color:#f9fafb; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; line-height:20px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; padding:15px 20px\"><span class=\"b-s\"><span class=\"b-d\">Register now</span></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" class=\"\" style=\"padding:0 0 50px\"><p align=\"left\" class=\"whale\" id=\"root\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#04363E; margin:0 0 30px\"><span class=\"linkfix\" id=\"linkfix\">Guy Hanson is joined by two renowned global deliverability experts to examine findings from the 2026 Email Deliverability Benchmark Report. They\'ll discuss program changes and optimizations your team should make based on the new data, including:</span></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"list\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:600px\"><tbody><tr><td aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dmBullet\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 30px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; width:14px; font-size:24px; line-height:24px; font-weight:700; color:#0A8DFF\">●</td><td align=\"left\" class=\"black\" role=\"listitem\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 30px 12px; font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#262524\">How to adjust your process to account for AI and new MBP rules affecting inbox placement.</td></tr><tr><td aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dmBullet\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 30px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; width:14px; font-size:24px; line-height:24px; font-weight:700; color:#0A8DFF\">●</td><td align=\"left\" class=\"black\" role=\"listitem\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 30px 12px; font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#262524\">Strategy tweaks to keep up with Microsoft, Gmail, and Yahoo\'s latest&nbsp;changes.</td></tr><tr><td aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dmBullet\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 30px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; width:14px; font-size:24px; line-height:24px; font-weight:700; color:#0A8DFF\">●</td><td align=\"left\" class=\"black\" role=\"listitem\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 30px 12px; font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#262524\">The email engagement metrics that matter most—and how to give them a&nbsp;boost.</td></tr></tbody></table><p align=\"left\" class=\"whale\" id=\"root\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:28px; font-weight:400; color:#04363E; margin:0 0 30px\"><span class=\"linkfix\" id=\"linkfix\">Whether you\'re managing millions of sends or fine-tuning a high‑value list, this is a must‑attend event for email marketers.</span></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"buttonBlue\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color:#0A8DFF; box-shadow:0 3px 6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.20); border-radius:25px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" background=\"https://campaigns.litmus.com/_email/2026/Product%20Announcement%20Email%20-%20Deliverability/bg_blue.png\" class=\"offwhite\" style=\"background-image:url(\'https://campaigns.litmus.com/_email/2026/Product%20Announcement%20Email%20-%20Deliverability/bg_blue.png\'); background-size:cover; background-repeat:repeat; bord