an style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Tim Lintner</strong></span><br><strong>Channel Director - Central&nbsp;</strong></p><div style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\">M: 920-288-1979</span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\">E: <a href=\"mailto:Timothy.Lintner@Zayo.com?q_mailing_7uvFTatb4ZsFveKEph1Lob4Pq1ZnN3SL5sTBW=RpG9mWmpQLVrAyBhwPnapw7YcuDZcS4NrLYVaVVivXLDEX4FUHWNTfbt3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Timothy.Lintner@Zayo.com</a></span>&nbsp;</div><p style=\"font-family:arial,san-serif; color:#f58220; font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://sales.zayo.com/t/108834/sc/006991ae-4b94-4b32-bd79--zayo-com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#f58220\"><strong>Zayo</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://sales.zayo.com/t/108834/sc/006991ae-4b94-4b32-bd79--zayo-com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#f58220\">The Network for What\'s Next</a></p><p style=\"font-family:arial,san-serif; color:#f58220; font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</p></div></div><br><br><div class=\"sl-email-footer mceNonEditable\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt\">&nbsp;</span></div><br><div><a class=\"sl_opt_out_link_class\" href=\"https://sales.zayo.com/t/108834/opt_out/006991ae-4b94-4b32-bd79-250e7d864ad5\">Receiving too many emails? Click here.</a></div></div></div></div><img alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://sales.zayo.com/t/108834/open/006991ae-4b94-4b32-bd79-250e7d864ad5.gif\"> </body></html>','Hi Jonathan,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAs you work toward your 2026 revenue goals, we want to be a resource—not just for network, but in supporting your broader strategy.\r\n\r\nMany partners are seeing success with Zayo’s 3X network SPIFF, and we’re also helping close revenue ','2026-04-08 16:04:19','neutral',0,NULL,NULL);
